{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47999","headline":"贻常夷诗 · 朱均","name":"贻常夷诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生游城郭，殂没委荒榛。\n自我辞人世，不知秋与春。\n牛羊久来牧，松柏几成薪。\n分绝车马好，甘随狐兔羣。\n何处清风至，君子幸爲邻。\n烈烈盛名德，依依伫良宾。\n千年何旦暮，一室动人神。\n乔木如在望，通衢良易遵。\n高门傥无隔，向与析龙津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱均","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47999.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47999","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}